---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Contact"
  description="Get in touch with Jim Miszaniec about instructional design, EdTech, corporate L&D, or faculty AI integration."
>
  <section class="wrap">
    <header class="pagehead">
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact &amp; collaborate</p>
      <h1>The best way to reach me is by email.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        I'm happy to share more about any of the projects in this portfolio, discuss how my work
        might apply to your context, or simply connect with others working at the intersection of
        learning science and AI.
      </p>
      <div class="ctarow">
        <a class="btn solid" href="mailto:jmmiszan@gmail.com">jmmiszan@gmail.com</a>
        <a class="btn" href="mailto:MiszaniecJ@camosun.ca">MiszaniecJ@camosun.ca</a>
      </div>
      <p class="loc">Victoria, BC, Canada</p>
    </header>

    <div class="topics reveal">
      <p class="topiclabel">Open to conversations about</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Instructional design and learning architecture roles</li>
        <li>EdTech content, curriculum, and product opportunities</li>
        <li>Corporate L&amp;D and customer enablement</li>
        <li>Fintech onboarding and learning enablement</li>
        <li>Faculty AI integration collaboration at Camosun or beyond</li>
        <li>Consulting, advisory, or project-based work</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .pagehead {
    padding: clamp(48px, 7vw, 80px) 0 clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .pagehead h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.5rem + 2.2vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .lede {
    margin-top: 16px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .ctarow {
    margin-top: 28px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .loc {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .topics {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-top: 36px;
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .topiclabel {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .topics ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.3em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .topics li + li {
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
</style>
